User: In the figure, point $O$ is the center of the circle, the measure of angle $RTB$ is 28 degrees, and the measure of angle $ROB$ is three times the measure of angle $SOT$. What is the measure of minor arc $RS$, in degrees? [asy]
unitsize(1.2cm);
defaultpen(linewidth(.7pt)+fontsize(8pt));
dotfactor=3;

pair A=(0,0), B=(-1,0), T=(2,0);
pair T0=T+10*dir(162);
pair[] RS=intersectionpoints(Circle(A,1),T--T0);
pair Sp=RS[0];
pair R=RS[1];
pair[] dots={A,B,T,Sp,R};
dot(dots);

draw(Circle(A,1));
draw(B--T--R);

label("$T$",T,S);
label("$O$",A,S);
label("$B$",B,W);
label("$R$",R,NW);
label("$S$",Sp,NE);
[/asy]
